Error [jet.CaseNumberOutOfRange]: Case `High` is 300, which `U8` can't hold
  --> tests/ui/enum_repair_raw_code.jet:5:12
    |
  5 |     High = 300
    |            ^^^
 Why: `#Layout(U8)` stores every case number of `Mode` as a `U8` (0 to 255)
 Fix: Use a number from 0 to 255, or a wider backing type
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1121
